SUMMARY:Holywell Choose Your Distance!
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Boris Kachscovsky\n\nChoose your distance!\n\nWe'll do 
 laps around Holywell. Each lap is 3.6km and we'll loop back to the start so
  drop off whenever you've had enough.\n\nGreat for those of you who might w
 ant to try for a longer distance.\n\n3.6k / 7.2k / 10.8k / 14.4k / etc.\n\n
 Holywell is lovely with a bit of a slope and some nice gas lamps\, but no s
 idewalks so bring as many lights / hi-viz things you can muster!\n\nWe'll m
 eet at the north entrance to Holywell. If driving park on Wells Road\, or a
 long Holywell and meet at the intersection of holywell and wells road.\n\n6
 -7min/km\, nobody left behind\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clu
 bs/208705/group_events/3550647684391340760\n\nSynced from Strava Club 20870
 5 on Thu\, 29 Oct @ 11:41 PM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Boris KachscovskyChoose your distance!
 We'll do laps around Holywell. Each lap is 3.6km and we'll loop back to the
  start so drop off whenever you've had enough.Great for those of you who mi
 ght want to try for a longer distance.3.6k / 7.2k / 10.8k / 14.4k / etc.Hol
 ywell is lovely with a bit of a slope and some nice gas lamps\, but no side
 walks so bring as many lights / hi-viz things you can muster!We'll meet at 
 the north entrance to Holywell. If driving park on Wells Road\, or along Ho
 lywell and meet at the intersection of holywell and wells road.6-7min/km\, 
 nobody left behindView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group
 _events/3550647684391340760Synced from Strava Club 208705 on: Thu\, 29 Oct 
 @ 11:41 PM
LOCATION:Holywell
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3550647684391340760
CATEGORIES:Running,Club Event
END:VEVENT
